This project uses Cordis (https://github.com/cordiverse/cordis, MIT License) as
its design reference. Tenon is a functional port of the Cordis kernel concepts to
Elixir/OTP: it reimplements the context, fiber, service and event semantics on
top of OTP processes and supervision trees. No Cordis source code is copied or
redistributed here; credit for the original design belongs to the Cordis authors.
